                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omwana amuntu, luzubo lwaIsrayeli lwandibeda mankwisila. Boonse baba mukuba amundalila abutale alotwe mukati kabbila lyamulilo. Baba mankwisila aansiliva. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.22.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.22.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 22:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkaambo kako mbuboobu mbwaamba Mwami Jehova. Mbuli mbumwaba mankwisila nyoonse njoomuyobolola mukati ka-Jerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.22.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.22.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 22:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mbubonya mbuli insiliva amukuba abutale alotwe amundalila mbuziyobololwa mukati kabbila lyamulilo kuti zifulidilwe mulilo akweenzununwa, njooyobolola ndinywe mubukali bwangu buyoosya, njoomusikka akumweenzununa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.22.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.22.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 22:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Njoomubunganya akumufulidila mulilo wabukali bwangu mane lumwi nkamweenzunune mukati kawo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.22.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.22.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 22:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mbubonya mbuli insiliva mbwiienzununwa mukati kabbila lyamulilo, muyooenzununwa anywebo mukati kawo, aboobo muyooziba kuti ndime nde-Jehova ndamutilila bukali bwangu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.22.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.22.22"
            ]
          }
        }
